  "title": "Subject–Verb Agreement",
  "estimatedMinutes": 8,
  "explanation": {
    "en": "In the simple present, he, she, and it usually take -s or -es. I, you, we, and they generally use the base verb.",
    "taglish": "Kapag he, she, o it, usually may -s o -es sa simple present. Base verb sa I, you, we, at they."
  },
